-de-brazza.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Pierre Savorgnan de Brazza</span><span class="tp">1852–1905</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/tomas-garrigue-masaryk"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/tomas-garrigue-masaryk.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Tomáš Garrigue Masaryk</span><span class="tp">1850–1937</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
